# Class-table features are rules text unless an explicit PCGen numeric grant is present.
Thaumaturge Invocation Uses (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_INVOCATION_USES|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_INVOCATION_USES|SPHERES_CASTING_ABILITY+floor(SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL/2)	DESC:%SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_INVOCATION_USES uses per day of invocations; only one invocation per roll; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
Thaumaturge Invocation DC (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_INVOCATION_DC|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_INVOCATION_DC|10+floor(SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL/2)+SPHERES_CASTING_ABILITY	DESC:%SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_INVOCATION_DC saving throw DC for invocations; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
Thaumaturge Forbidden Lore (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_FORBIDDEN_LORE|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_FORBIDDEN_LORE|2+floor((SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL-1)/4)	DESC:%SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_FORBIDDEN_LORE caster-level increase on one qualifying effect when invoked, subject to backlash; not a permanent caster-level increase; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
