Thaumaturge Master Invoker - Lingering Blessing	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Master Invoker	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,20	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Thaumaturge Invocations,Thaumaturge Lingering Blessing	DESC:Use Lingering Blessing without expending daily invocation uses. All activation conditions and the one-invocation-per-roll restriction still apply.
Thaumaturge Master Invoker - Lingering Pain	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Master Invoker	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,20	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Thaumaturge Invocations,Thaumaturge Lingering Pain	DESC:Use Lingering Pain without expending daily invocation uses. All activation conditions and the one-invocation-per-roll restriction still apply.
