Thaumaturge Master Invoker - Defensive Invocation	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Master Invoker	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,20	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Thaumaturge Invocations,Thaumaturge Defensive Invocation	DESC:Use Defensive Invocation without expending daily invocation uses. All activation conditions and the one-invocation-per-roll restriction still apply.
