Thaumaturge Master Invoker - Soulfire	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Master Invoker	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,20	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Thaumaturge Invocations,Thaumaturge Soulfire	DESC:Use Soulfire without expending daily invocation uses. All activation conditions and the one-invocation-per-roll restriction still apply.
Thaumaturge Master Invoker - Empowered Resistance	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Master Invoker	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,20	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Thaumaturge Invocations,Thaumaturge Empowered Resistance	DESC:Use Empowered Resistance without expending daily invocation uses. All activation conditions and the one-invocation-per-roll restriction still apply.
Thaumaturge Master Invoker - Flexible Caster	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Master Invoker	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,20	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Thaumaturge Invocations,Thaumaturge Flexible Caster	DESC:Use Flexible Caster without expending daily invocation uses. All activation conditions and the one-invocation-per-roll restriction still apply.
Thaumaturge Occult Knowledge	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	BONUS:SKILL|TYPE.Knowledge,Spellcraft,Use Magic Device|min(5,1+floor((SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL-2)/4))	DESC:Scaling bonus to Knowledge, Spellcraft and Use Magic Device checks.
Thaumaturge Lingering Blessing	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Invocations	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,1	DESC:At 1st level, when using forbidden lore to augment a spell or sphere effect, the thaumaturge may use an invocation to cause the affected targets to gain 1 temporary hit point per thaumaturge level for 1 round per thaumaturge level.
Thaumaturge Lingering Pain	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Invocations	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,1	DESC:At 1st level, when using forbidden lore to augment a spell or sphere effect, the thaumaturge may use an invocation to cause the affected targets to become sickened for 1 round (Fortitude negates).
Thaumaturge Meditation	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Invocations	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,1	DESC:At 1st level, the thaumaturge may reroll a failed Knowledge check. The thaumaturge may only use this ability once for any given Knowledge check.
Thaumaturge Empowered Attack	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Invocations	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,3	DESC:At 3rd level, when using forbidden lore to augment a spell or sphere effect, the thaumaturge may use an invocation to grant himself a bonus to attack rolls equal to his forbidden lore bonus for a number of rounds equal to his casting ability modifier.
Thaumaturge Empowered Defense	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Invocations	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,3	DESC:At 3rd level, when using forbidden lore to augment a spell or sphere effect, the thaumaturge may use an invocation to grant himself a dodge bonus to AC equal to his forbidden lore bonus for a number of rounds equal to his casting ability modifier.
Thaumaturge Channel Punishment	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Invocations	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,7	DESC:At 7th level, if the thaumaturge suffers backlash when using forbidden lore, he may use an invocation to pass the penalty off to another creature within 30 feet. If that creature is unwilling, they are allowed a Will save to negate this effect. On a successful save, the thaumaturge suffers the effect of the backlash as normal.
Thaumaturge Defensive Invocation	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Invocations	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,7	DESC:At 7th level, before attempting a saving throw, the thaumaturge may use an invocation to add his forbidden lore bonus to the roll.
Thaumaturge Item Lore	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Invocations	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,11	DESC:At 11th level, the thaumaturge may use an invocation to add his forbidden lore bonus to the caster level of a spell-completion or spell-trigger magic item he is wielding for 1 round. This bonus only functions while the item is being wielded by the thaumaturge.
Thaumaturge Soulfire	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Invocations	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,11	DESC:At 11th level, when the thaumaturge suffers backlash from using forbidden lore, he may use an invocation to empower himself. He gains a bonus to attack rolls, saving throws, and a dodge bonus to AC equal to his forbidden lore bonus for a number of rounds equal to his casting ability modifier. This does not negate the penalty gained through the backlash itself.
Thaumaturge Empowered Resistance	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Invocations	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,15	DESC:At 15th level, if the thaumaturge succeeds at a saving throw against an attack that has a reduced effect on a successful save, he may use an invocation to negate the effect entirely.
Thaumaturge Flexible Caster	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Invocations	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,15	DESC:At 15th level, the thaumaturge may use an invocation to gain use of a single magic talent of his choice for 1 minute. He must meet the prerequisites (if any) and he can gain a base sphere he does not already possess with this ability. A thaumaturge may only have one use of flexible caster active at any one time; using this invocation again replaces the previous use.
Thaumaturge Rebuke Death	CATEGORY:Thaumaturge Invocations	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_THAUMATURGE_LEVEL,19	DESC:At 19th level, when the thaumaturge is reduced to 0 hit points or fewer, the thaumaturge may use two of his remaining invocations to instead be reduced to 1 hit point. Effects that kill the thaumaturge outright without dealing hit point damage are not affected by this ability.
Thaumaturge Bonus Feats	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Choose an extra magic talent or feat with casting as a prerequisite every four thaumaturge levels; validate eligibility manually.
